{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>GAME FEATURES:</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">1st Person POV Point-and-Click style</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Includes fully voiced characters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Explore Detailed 2D Environments</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Solve Clues and Puzzles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Journal &amp; clue tracking system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Investigate a Wedding Sabotage</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Choice-Driven Dialogue</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">For fans of Nancy Drew, Myst, and other cozy mystery games</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2022\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2022\u00b0\u2022\u2740\u2022\u00b0\u2022\u00b0\u2022\u2740\u2022\u00b0\u2022\u00b0\u2022\u2740\u2022\u00b0\u2022\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2022</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>GAME PLOT:</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The night before the wedding, the altar burns down by itself, and the wedding planner gets injured. The family thinks it's because of a curse but she thinks someone is a suspect. You play as a regular college student who has a knack for sleuthing. You get hired as the replacement wedding planner to go undercover. Find out if the curse is real or if someone is trying to sabotage the couple. At the same time, you must make sure the postponed ceremony still goes on without a hitch. You\u2019ll get to explore multiple locations, Solve fun puzzles, discover important clues, and question every suspect. Find out the truth before the wedding!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2022\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2022\u00b0\u2022\u2740\u2022\u00b0\u2022\u00b0\u2022\u2740\u2022\u00b0\u2022\u00b0\u2022\u2740\u2022\u00b0\u2022\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2022</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074040/extras/0f183e4bbc676a125700963541a5ff19.avif?t=1762731323\" width=616 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>EXPLORE:</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Explore beautifully crafted 2D environments from a first-person perspective. Step into Vivian's shoes as  a stand-in wedding planner who\u2019s secretly investigating sabotage.  Every room, is filled with secrets waiting to be uncovered. Click, search, and snoop your way through atmospheric locations brought to life with stunning detail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074040/extras/f5680b3fbeea52aaef3d1c415289a4ca.poster.avif?t=1762731323\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074040/extras/f5680b3fbeea52aaef3d1c415289a4ca.webm?t=1762731323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074040/extras/f5680b3fbeea52aaef3d1c415289a4ca.mp4?t=1762731323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2022\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2022\u00b0\u2022\u2740\u2022\u00b0\u2022\u00b0\u2022\u2740\u2022\u00b0\u2022\u00b0\u2022\u2740\u2022\u00b0\u2022\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2022</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074040/extras/0dff92830e92e64753513fa27c6a541e.avif?t=1762731323\" width=616 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>PUZZLES:</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Put your detective skills to the test with fun puzzles of different variety, and secret codes. Some puzzles are even drawn from wedding duties. Every challenge ties directly into the mystery, and gets you one step closer to solving the case.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074040/extras/124fc99713ba71c1f39ca933e445740f.poster.avif?t=1762731323\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074040/extras/124fc99713ba71c1f39ca933e445740f.webm?t=1762731323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074040/extras/124fc99713ba71c1f39ca933e445740f.mp4?t=1762731323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2022\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2022\u00b0\u2022\u2740\u2022\u00b0\u2022\u00b0\u2022\u2740\u2022\u00b0\u2022\u00b0\u2022\u2740\u2022\u00b0\u2022\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2022</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074040/extras/00c31ea71bc781804b101dd16c19fe5e.avif?t=1762731323\" width=616 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>MYSTERY:</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Experience a fun mix of cozy warmth and a gripping mystery. What begins as a \u201cperfect day\u201d turns into a web of scandals, family secrets, and hidden motives that only you can untangle. Follow an engaging story packed with unexpected turns, hidden motives, and surprising reveals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074040/extras/0c33ca33406a62293928d925ab9688fd.poster.avif?t=1762731323\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074040/extras/0c33ca33406a62293928d925ab9688fd.webm?t=1762731323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074040/extras/0c33ca33406a62293928d925ab9688fd.mp4?t=1762731323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2022\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2022\u00b0\u2022\u2740\u2022\u00b0\u2022\u00b0\u2022\u2740\u2022\u00b0\u2022\u00b0\u2022\u2740\u2022\u00b0\u2022\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2022</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:/