00\u2500\u2500\u2022</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074040/extras/6b29645870879e6bf05c475526bb1a09.avif?t=1762731323\" width=616 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>SUSPECTS:</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Balance your cover story with your detective instincts as you talk to intriguing characters, uncover their alibis, and dig up the secrets they\u2019d rather keep hidden. Your choices in conversation can reveal new information or lead you further into danger. Every dialogue offers multiple tones that changes how suspects react and which clues you uncover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074040/extras/9bc60924ad3a97b3db9dc36409f151e3.poster.avif?t=1762731323\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074040/extras/9bc60924ad3a97b3db9dc36409f151e3.webm?t=1762731323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074040/extras/9bc60924ad3a97b3db9dc36409f151e3.mp4?t=1762731323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Michelley Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074040/b8e192a9e1eb03d567f9c01419a5b2d8226d3020/header.jpg?t=1762731323","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"